{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> First Episode of &quot;Not a Good Fairy Tale&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Palaces of The Mind</strong> is a 2D mystical adventure that tells the story of how the most ordinary day of two friends turned into a nightmare. Becca, her owl Dolly, and Meg must now escape from the world of animeds, forest creatures that can smell fear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, they realize that this world is not as simple as it seems at first glance, but finding all the secrets will not be easy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will anyone help them on this adventure? Who knows? Maybe it will be you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[A mystical story about the escape of two girls in the world of animeds]</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The ability to change the main character]</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Puzzles of varying difficulty]</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Easter eggs and hidden plot twists]</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Original soundtrack]</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\"Mission: to piss off Meg\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836490/fa42b78aee233cce00d4694cd914ba1070b1df32.jpg"},{"name":"The best friend in the inventory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836490/cb4320b919c3f33fee43a45cdc26de94fde2214d.jpg"},{"name":"The power of friendship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836490/9492fbca327eaacc8b196eb6b194fecc04efa3fa.jpg"},{"name":"The Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com